# Input

```svelte
{#snippet parts()}{#if leftIcon}<span class="left-icon">{@render leftIcon()}</span>{/if}{@render children?.()}{#if rightIcon}<span class="right-icon">{@render rightIcon()}</span>{/if}{/snippet}

<p><span>{format("communication.contacts.info")}</span>{#if showAddons}<span>{format("communication.contacts.addons")}</span>{/if}</p>

<label><span class="addon">{format("dashboards.sensorMaps.lat")}</span><BoundInput value={latitude} onchange={setLatitude} /></label>

<span class="back"><Icon name="BiChevronLeft" size="24px" /><span class="dashboard-name">{dashboardName}</span></span>

```


# Options

```json
{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../../packages/@biomejs/biome/configuration_schema.json",
  "html": {
    "formatter": {
      "whitespaceSensitivity": "strict"
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```svelte
{#snippet parts()}
	{#if leftIcon}
		<span class="left-icon">{@render leftIcon()}</span>
	{/if}{@render children?.()}{#if rightIcon}
		<span class="right-icon">{@render rightIcon()}</span>
	{/if}
{/snippet}

<p
	><span>{format("communication.contacts.info")}</span>{#if showAddons}
		<span>{format("communication.contacts.addons")}</span>
	{/if}</p
>

<label
	><span class="addon">{format("dashboards.sensorMaps.lat")}</span><BoundInput
		value={latitude}
		onchange={setLatitude}
	/></label
>

<span class="back"
	><Icon name="BiChevronLeft" size="24px" /><span class="dashboard-name"
		>{dashboardName}</span
	></span
>

```
